<p><strong>Sara Nović</strong> is the author of the novels <a href="https://bookshop.org/a/132/9780593241523" class="external" target="_blank"><em>True Biz</em></a> and <a href="https://bookshop.org/a/132/9780812986396" class="external" target="_blank"><em>Girl at War</em></a>, nonfiction <a href="https://bookshop.org/a/132/9781984819833" class="external" target="_blank"><em>America is Immigrants</em></a>, and a new memoir, <a href="https://bookshop.org/a/132/9780593241530" class="external" target="_blank"><em>Mother Tongue</em></a>. They’re an instructor of Deaf studies and creative writing, and live in Philadelphia with their family.</p>
